{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 13 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">配准与投影几何：可微变换、拓扑约束和 SE(3) 闭环</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Registration &amp; SE(3)</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_125_transmorph-title\">TransMorph</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">TransMorph 用层级 Swin encoder 取代纯 CNN 配准编码器，同时保留 U-Net 式 decoder 和可微 warping。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Replaces the convolutional encoder in VoxelMorph with a 3D hierarchical Swin Transformer encoder while retaining a convolutional U-Net decoder and Spatial Transformer warping.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">moving 图像 Im 与 fixed 图像 If</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Concatenated 3D moving and fixed volumes (I_m, I_f)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">稠密位移场 φ、warped moving 图像及可选不确定性估计</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Dense 3D displacement field φ, warped moving image I_m ∘ φ, and optional Bayesian uncertainty</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/36156420/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_125_transmorph')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_125_transmorph')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"TransMorph original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/a90011a16ef8f12b4c32.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_125_transmorph', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_125_transmorph\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_125_transmorph')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_125_transmorph', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_125_transmorph\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">Moving/fixed pair</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Moving/fixed pair</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">按通道拼接的 2D 或 3D 医学图像</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests concatenated 3d moving and fixed volumes (i_m, i_f) and prepares initial tensor representations (Moving/fixed pair).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"按通道拼接的 2D 或 3D 医学图像\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests concatenated 3d moving and fixed volumes (i_m, i_f) and prepares initial tensor representations (Moving/fixed pair).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"Moving/fixed pair\" data-node-name-en=\"Moving/fixed pair\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_125_transmorph', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Moving/fixed pair</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按通道拼接的 2D 或 3D 医学图像</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests concatenated 3d moving and fixed volumes (i_m, i_f) and prepares initial tensor representations (Moving/fixed pair).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将图像对变为层级视觉 token\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Patch partition/embedding to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Patch partition/embedding\" data-node-name-en=\"Patch partition/embedding\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_125_transmorph', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Patch partition/embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将图像对变为层级视觉 token</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Patch partition/embedding to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"窗口与 shifted-window attention 建模局部和长程对应\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Swin Transformer encoder within the core swin transformer hybrid registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Swin Transformer encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Swin Transformer encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_125_transmorph', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Swin Transformer encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">窗口与 shifted-window attention 建模局部和长程对应</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Swin Transformer encoder within the core swin transformer hybrid registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"patch merging 产生不同分辨率的对应线索\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs multi-scale Transformer features within the core swin transformer hybrid registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"多尺度 Transformer features\" data-node-name-en=\"multi-scale Transformer features\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_125_transmorph', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多尺度 Transformer features</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multi-scale Transformer features</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">patch merging 产生不同分辨率的对应线索</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs multi-scale Transformer features within the core swin transformer hybrid registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"逐级上采样并融合 encoder skip features\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs U-Net convolution decoder within the core swin transformer hybrid registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"U-Net 式卷积 decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"U-Net convolution decoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_125_transmorph', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">U-Net 式卷积 decoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">U-Net convolution decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">逐级上采样并融合 encoder skip features</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs U-Net convolution decoder within the core swin transformer hybrid registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"卷积输出每体素位移向量 φ\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Displacement field head within the core swin transformer hybrid registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Displacement field head\" data-node-name-en=\"Displacement field head\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_125_transmorph', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Displacement field head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">卷积输出每体素位移向量 φ</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Displacement field head within the core swin transformer hybrid registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"以可微插值计算 Im∘φ\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Spatial transformer within the core swin transformer hybrid registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Spatial transformer\" data-node-name-en=\"Spatial transformer\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_125_transmorph', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Spatial transformer</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">以可微插值计算 Im∘φ</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Spatial transformer within the core swin transformer hybrid registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"无需真实形变标签；可扩展 diffeomorphic 或 Bayesian 版本\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies NCC/ + regularization to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"NCC/相似度 + 平滑正则\" data-node-name-en=\"NCC/ + regularization\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_125_transmorph', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">NCC/相似度 + 平滑正则</span><span class=\"lang-en\">NCC/ + regularization</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">无需真实形变标签；可扩展 diffeomorphic 或 Bayesian 版本</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies NCC/ + regularization to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"稠密场、warped image 和可选 uncertainty\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces dense 3d displacement field φ, warped moving image i_m ∘ φ, and optional bayesian uncertainty via Registered Output.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"配准结果\" data-node-name-en=\"Registered Output\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_125_transmorph', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">配准结果</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Registered Output</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">稠密场、warped image 和可选 uncertainty</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces dense 3d displacement field φ, warped moving image i_m ∘ φ, and optional bayesian uncertainty via Registered Output.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"TransMorph Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · Transformer 全局对应建模与无