ink:href=\"#m125_g1-61\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"101.239035\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g4-0\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"109.23567\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g17-78\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"116.279249\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g17-67\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"122.924328\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g17-67\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"130.067541\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g4-185\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"134.192073\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g10-30\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"139.040883\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g7-53\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"143.080829\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g10-150\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"147.749935\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g10-30\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"151.362387\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g7-60\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"160.074369\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g4-14\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"167.488727\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g10-113\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"173.167438\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g4-186\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"179.19698\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g4-184\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"187.617572\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g10-95\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"193.63002\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g4-107\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"198.212835\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g4-114\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"205.176703\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g10-113\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"211.353548\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g4-107\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"215.836734\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g14-50\" y=\"-64.102131\"></use><use x=\"215.836734\" xlink:href=\"#m125_g14-50\" y=\"-56.961428\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">CNN 配准局部感受野难处理远距离解剖对应</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Small 3×3×3 CNN kernels in early encoder stages struggled to establish long-range spatial correspondence across large anatomical displacements.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用 Swin Transformer 编码固定/移动图像的长程对应，再由卷积 decoder 输出形变</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Leverage 3D Swin Transformer blocks in the encoder to capture larger effective receptive fields for cross-volume matching.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">层级窗口注意力结合 U-Net 式多尺度解码增强全局匹配</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Hybrid 3D Swin encoder + CNN skip decoder + diffeomorphic/Bayesian variants benchmarked across brain MRI and CT.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">成为脑 MRI 和腹部 CT Transformer 配准的常用基线</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Standard Transformer-based 3D medical image registration baseline.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">重要架构基线；长程 attention 本身不保证拓扑、对称或跨域稳健</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Important architectural comparison point; attention in the encoder does not automatically prevent folding without GradICON/diffeomorphic constraints.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">Swin 的层级窗口注意力在可控成本下捕获远距离解剖对应。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">Transformer encoder 提供多尺度 skip，卷积 decoder 恢复稠密局部位移。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">Spatial transformer 把形变放回图像域，以相似度和场正则进行无监督训练。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Leverage 3D Swin Transformer blocks in the encoder to capture larger effective receptive fields for cross-volume matching.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Hybrid 3D Swin encoder + CNN skip decoder + diffeomorphic/Bayesian variants benchmarked across brain MRI and CT.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: 3D Shifted-Window Transformer Correspondence Encoding + Differentiable Deformation Decoding.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">是脑 MRI 与腹部 CT 中常用的 Transformer 配准基线。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">attention 可表达长程匹配但不保证拓扑；必须检查 Jacobian folding、landmark TRE 和跨模态相似度适用性。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Standard Transformer-based 3D medical image registration baseline.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Important architectural comparison point; attention in the encoder does not automatically prevent folding without GradICON/diffeomorphic constraints.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/36156420/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>TransMorph: Transformer for Unsupervised Medical Image Registration</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/junyuchen245/TransMorph_Transformer_for_Medical_Image_Registration\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}